  "cards": [
    {
      "dot": "emerald",
      "title": "Core 產物與中斷保底",
      "items": [
        "RunBackend 寫出 seq 日誌與 WAL manifest；Usage Reporter 寫出 agent_usage。",
        "即使迴圈拋錯中斷，Core 仍會先寫出 skipped_aborted 成本與分析產物。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "amber",
      "title": "Core 與 Plugin 報表切分",
      "items": [
        "Plugin Reporter 只對 RunResult 做領域投影，不能回頭更改單案 verdict。",
        "Core 在 plugin reporter 執行完後才把 core_agent_analysis 與 cost 指針附進 payload。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "slate",
      "title": "來源鎖定",
